# Python bytecode, written wherever a module is imported.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Compiled bundles, written wherever pf is run. A file under fixtures/ named
# as a bundle is the corpus's own, a source or an expected bundle, so it is
# tracked, and so is an expected bundle an example's tests hold.
*.bundle.md
!fixtures/**/*.bundle.md
!example/*/expected/**/*.bundle.md

# The diagram-following eval's session records, written by each run.
evals/diagram-following/results/
